<title>MEXICO: Hilasal Q1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Hilasal Q1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>Shr		 n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>Oper Income     11.39 million		8.88 million</p>
<p>Net		 14.41 million		13.29 million</p>
<p>Revs		44.10 million		41.00 million</p>
<p>Integ fin cost  312,000	   gain 3.96 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is Hilasal Mexicana SA.</p>
